#: ../recording.rst:234
msgid "Enable :guilabel:`Webcam` to record a camera as a silent video clip. A live preview helps verify framing before you start. When Screen is also enabled, the default layout is a rounded, 30% camera in the bottom-right corner. When the webcam is recorded alone, it defaults to full size."
msgstr ""

